{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not inspect input when collection is disabled**\n\nEven with `content.input(false)`, this converts the input through the plugin\u2019s Jackson mapper. For custom-SerDes objects that can invoke getters and other serialization side effects before the handler, and large excluded inputs still incur avoidable allocation and latency. Check `includeInput` first and cache explicit absence without touching the value; add a disabled-input test using a side-effecting non-Jackson payload.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNF77","finding_digest":"f74add3470e39517380d2850cc17c0f303247036b98764326c11164511677391","finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","line":120,"observation_digest":"4f1bc9ef1fb8e1337f473c69d07ea6514986486261adff78d5c21f3673ee0c17","observation_id":"aro_v1_j4n4t3y7xdqtg72hhru5a7vgkf","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":120,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_qsbzygpxzz4lkcybwfizdhaukp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
